% presence: the edge facts of the presence contract (presence.yaml). Declarations only; the levels are the
% members' own (beliefs:/levels: on the world's port `present`).
catalog world_presence 1.
types (room).
namespace world_presence produce (dyn).
pred entered(room) : world_presence.
pred came_home : world_presence.
pred left_home : world_presence.
pred unavailable_presence : world_presence.
